{"baka":[{"id":"baka","headword":"बक","headword_slp1":"baka","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"— 1〉 m.\n — a〉 eine Reiherart, Ardea nivea GAUT. Gilt für einen Ausbund ruhiger Besonnenheit, aber auch der Schelmerei und Heuchelei.\n — b〉 Heuchler, Betrüger.\n — c〉 eine best. Pflanze.\n — d〉 *ein best. Apparat zum Calciniren oder Sublimiren von Metallen.\n — e〉 *Bein. Kuberaʼs.\n— 2〉 f. N. pr.\n — α〉 eines Dämons MĀN. GṚ"},{"t":"cite","s":"HY. 2,14","q":"HY"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n — β〉 eines von Bhīmasena besiegten Rakṣas.\n — γ〉 eines von Kṛṣṇa besiegten Asura, der die Gestalt eines Reihers angenommen hatte.\n — δ〉 eines alten Weisen mit dem Patron. Dālbhi oder Dālbhya.\n — ε〉 eines Bauern HEM. "},{"t":"cite","s":"PAR. 2,356","q":"PAR"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n — ζ〉 Pl. eines Volkes "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBH. 6,9,61","q":"MBH"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n — η〉 eines Fürsten."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"बक, am Ende hinzuzufügen: 2〉 (f. ई) a〉 *f. zu बक 1〉a〉 Comm. zu "},{"t":"cite","s":"VĀSAV. 99","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". — b〉 = पूतना (die Unholdin)."}]},{"n":3,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"बक "},{"t":"cite","s":"IV. 5","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]},{"id":"bAka","headword":"बाक","headword_slp1":"bAka","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"*बाक n. eine Menge von Reihern."}]}]}],"bakakacCa":[{"id":"bakakacCa","headword":"बककच्छ","headword_slp1":"bakakacCa","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"बककच्छ m. N. pr. einer Oertlichkeit."}]}]}],"bakakalpa":[{"id":"bakakalpa","headword":"बककल्प","headword_slp1":"bakakalpa","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"बककल्प m. ein best. Kalpa 2〉h〉."}]}]}],"bakaciYcika":[{"id":"bakaciYcikA","headword":"बकचिञ्चिका","headword_slp1":"bakaciYcikA","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"*बकचिञ्चिका f. ein best. Fisch."}]}]}],"bakajit":[{"id":"bakajit","headword":"बकजित्","headword_slp1":"bakajit","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"*बकजित् m. Bein. Bhīmasenaʼs."}]}]}],"bakatva":[{"id":"bakatva","headword":"बकत्व","